<!DOCTYPE html><html data-dpl-id="dpl_EofVtde3C4BdQ486ug5omL519EsN" lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1wjzvi_w_58jv.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ddg70z30qn04.js"/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/41b5e_o-w2xun.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1cmnso0jnkwt6.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2-k_577svdq9-.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/turbopack-2l6qdc9b47pt9.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/09nx881wbf89m.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><title>Documentation · MCPCN</title><meta name="description" content="React components and workflow blocks for human-controlled MCP Apps."/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg?icon.0-2l4nus4v8l3.svg" sizes="any" type="image/svg+xml"/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0c0hxoamwjsbw.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class="site-nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">M</span>MCPCN</a><nav><a href="/docs">Docs</a><a href="/components">Components</a><a href="/blocks">Blocks</a><a href="/examples">Examples</a><a href="/playground">Playground</a></nav><div class="nav-actions"><a class="button secondary" href="/create">Create</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui" class="button">GitHub</a></div></header><main class="docs-layout"><aside class="sidebar" aria-label="Documentation sections"><strong>Getting started</strong><a href="#contract">The contract</a><a href="#install">Install</a><a href="#provider">Mount your provider</a><a href="#first-component">Your first component</a><a href="#host-compatibility">Host compatibility</a><a href="#security-boundaries">Security boundaries</a><a href="#registry">Registry</a><a href="#server-helpers">Server helpers</a></aside><article class="prose" style="min-width:0"><span class="eyebrow">Documentation</span><h1>Build a reviewable agent workflow</h1><p>MCPCN connects structured MCP tool results to React review surfaces. Your application handles user actions and validates every operation on the server.</p><h2 id="contract">The contract</h2><pre class="code">Tool structuredContent
  → validate the payload and component schema
  → render a typed component or a safe error
  → user reviews and acts
  → your application calls a permitted tool
  → render the updated result</pre><h2 id="install">Install into an existing React app</h2><p>Install the matching GitHub release archives, then use the local executable. The registry URL below is pinned to that release&#x27;s source.</p><p>The installer prepares TypeScript files and configuration. It does not create a framework app, install dependencies automatically or establish a host connection.</p><h3>Own the source</h3><p>Copy components, schemas, runtime and shared styles into your app. Workflow blocks include their component dependencies. The release setup below also installs the required SDK/schema dependencies.</p><section aria-label="Source installation"><div data-archive-release="v0.1.0-keyboard.1"><p>Use Node 24 and an existing React 19.2 TypeScript app. These commands install the eight matching packages from the <a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/tag/v0.1.0-keyboard.1">checked GitHub release</a>, then run its local CLI. Public npm publication remains separate.</p><p>For pnpm 10, the first block uses npm to record the release URLs and checked SDK/schema/type versions in your project&#x27;s <code>pnpm.overrides</code>, then installs with pnpm. Review these project-local pins alongside your existing overrides.</p><ol style="padding-left:24px"><li><h3>Install the matching release packages</h3><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy release packages">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="release packages"><code>npm pkg set \
  pnpm.overrides.@mcpcn/core=https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-core-0.1.0.tgz \
  pnpm.overrides.@mcpcn/schemas=https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-schemas-0.1.0.tgz \
  pnpm.overrides.@mcpcn/runtime=https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-runtime-0.1.0.tgz \
  pnpm.overrides.@mcpcn/react=https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-react-0.1.0.tgz \
  pnpm.overrides.@mcpcn/themes=https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-themes-0.1.0.tgz \
  pnpm.overrides.@mcpcn/registry=https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-registry-0.1.0.tgz \
  pnpm.overrides.mcpcn=https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-0.1.0.tgz \
  pnpm.overrides.@mcpcn/server=https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-server-0.1.0.tgz \
  pnpm.overrides.zod=4.4.3 \
  pnpm.overrides.@modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps=1.7.5 \
  pnpm.overrides.@modelcontextprotocol/sdk=1.30.0 \
  pnpm.overrides.@types/node=24.13.3
pnpm add --ignore-scripts --save-exact \
  https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-core-0.1.0.tgz \
  https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-schemas-0.1.0.tgz \
  https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-runtime-0.1.0.tgz \
  https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-react-0.1.0.tgz \
  https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-themes-0.1.0.tgz \
  https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-registry-0.1.0.tgz \
  https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-0.1.0.tgz \
  https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/releases/download/v0.1.0-keyboard.1/mcpcn-server-0.1.0.tgz \
  zod@4.4.3 \
  @modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps@1.7.5 \
  @modelcontextprotocol/sdk@1.30.0 \
  @types/node@24.13.3</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div></li><li><h3>Initialize your configuration</h3><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy initialization">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="initialization"><code>node node_modules/mcpcn/dist/index.js init --mode=copy --style=default --host=auto --manager=pnpm --components-dir=components/mcpcn --registry=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/d91fe403eb6b3ec07ef9791e47a8655f5ed519f3/registry/items</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div></li><li><h3>Add your selected items</h3><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy selected items">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="selected items"><code>node node_modules/mcpcn/dist/index.js add review-before-action</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div></li></ol><p class="mcpcn-hint">Step 1 installs the release and its consumer dependencies. The local CLI&#x27;s generic registry dependency hint is already covered for this pinned release. Steps 2–3 prepare files and configuration; they do not create a framework app or connect a live host.</p><details><summary>Review release archive hashes</summary><ul><li><code>mcpcn-core-0.1.0.tgz</code><br/><code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere">734b822d1a4b74da184a07155f1273e809ce67af701b22cd672c238acb98e54d</code></li><li><code>mcpcn-schemas-0.1.0.tgz</code><br/><code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere">84702229c679d6eb45b298378196ddb0b75dde7b642fc222fefc4db3a9ca805b</code></li><li><code>mcpcn-runtime-0.